        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'M LATE!!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've overslept! Play as a high school girl who's late for class and facing a chaotic dash to school. In this short, 2D top-down runner, you'll need to overcome a series of ridiculous familiar anime tropes obstacles to get to class before 8 AM.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Chaotic Gameplay:</strong> A simple control scheme lets you jump right into the action  and weave through an anime-inspired chaotic world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cast of Craziness:</strong> Encounter a vibrant cast of characters including a mischievous witch, fallen idol and more, all ready to create pandemonium on your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toast of Tardiness:</strong> Don't forget your breakfast! Grab a piece of jam-covered toast to unlock a special ability that will help you overcome the most absurd challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Anime Pixel Art:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world bursting with color, brought to life through charming, easy-looking and expressive pixel art.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'M LATE!!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've overslept! Play as a high school girl who's late for class and facing a chaotic dash to school. In this short, 2D top-down runner, you'll need to overcome a series of ridiculous familiar anime tropes obstacles to get to class before 8 AM.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Chaotic Gameplay:</strong> A simple control scheme lets you jump right into the action  and weave through an anime-inspired chaotic world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cast of Craziness:</strong> Encounter a vibrant cast of characters including a mischievous witch, fallen idol and more, all ready to create pandemonium on your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toast of Tardiness:</strong> Don't forget your breakfast! Grab a piece of jam-covered toast to unlock a special ability that will help you overcome the most absurd challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Anime Pixel Art:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world bursting with color, brought to life through charming, easy-looking and expressive pixel art.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A game about a high school student who's late for class and must overcome a series of ridiculous obstacles to get to school on time. Navigate a gauntlet of familiar anime tropes.",
